<title>USA: Weirton Steel Corp Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Weirton Steel Corp Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WEIRTON, W.Va. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.29     loss	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss		  12,300     loss	 2,800</p>
<p> Revs		     349,600		  340,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results reflect unplanned outage at hot strip mill, rebuild annd start-up of No. 1 Blast Furnace and minor disruptions in primary  metals facilities.</p>
<p>Q1 Shipments: 698,500 tons vs 712,000 tons.</p>
